  "title": "Asante Empire",
  "summary": "Asante, centred on Kumasi in what is now Ghana, was established around 1680 under Osei Tutu and overthrew Denkyira in 1701. Its rulers sat on the Golden Stool, and the state sold gold and enslaved people to European traders for firearms. It fought Britain repeatedly between 1824 and 1902, when it became a British Crown colony.",
