      "note": "Pages give the founding as \"about 1680\" (Encyclopedia.com) and 1670 (ACONA), with Denkyira overthrown in 1701; end is the annexation as a Crown colony on 1 January 1902 per Encyclopedia.com. ACONA instead says annexation in January 1896 or 26 September 1901."
